    Fix notify.js safeErrorMessage returning empty string for falsy throws
    
    A driver that throws a falsy value (e.g. throw '') produced
    delivery.error === '', violating AC-6/AC-8/AC-9's non-empty error
    requirement. Fall back to 'unknown error' when no message is derivable.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019Y8PoKeAxY1UqCFsE9FZsw

